      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vidéos"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vrac suggests which copies to move to the Trash, never all of them. You review everything first.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vrac propose les copies à placer dans la Corbeille, jamais toutes. Vous vérifiez tout avant."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which copy of each group stays where it is. The others are selected for the Trash.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La copie de chaque groupe qui reste en place. Les autres sont sélectionnées pour la Corbeille."
          }
        }
      }
    },
